    "body": "Always remember that the content model applies only to authors, i.e. for determining which documents can call themselves \"valid\". It has no impact on implementations! https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#conformance-requirements-for-authors https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#conformance-classes.",
